#!/usr/bin/env bash
source ~/.claude/tier0.env 2>/dev/null

# Fire all Tier 0 models in background (non-blocking)
~/.claude/bin/tier0-blast-async 2>/dev/null &

# Build live status
OLLAMA_MODEL=$(PATH="/Applications/Ollama.app/Contents/Resources:$PATH" ollama list 2>/dev/null | tail -n +2 | awk '{print $1}' | head -1)
ACTIVE=""
GPT4ALL_MODEL="$HOME/Library/Application Support/nomic.ai/GPT4All/Meta-Llama-3-8B-Instruct.Q4_0.gguf"
[ -f "$GPT4ALL_MODEL" ] && ACTIVE="GPT4All(Meta-Llama-3-8B-local)"
[ -n "$OLLAMA_MODEL" ] && ACTIVE="$ACTIVE | Ollama($OLLAMA_MODEL)"
[ -n "$GROQ_API_KEY" ] && ACTIVE="$ACTIVE | Groq(llama3-70b)"
[ -n "$GEMINI_API_KEY" ] && ACTIVE="$ACTIVE | Gemini(flash) | Gemma4-31B(GoogleAI)"
[ -n "$OPENROUTER_API_KEY" ] && ACTIVE="$ACTIVE | Gemma4-31B:free(OpenRouter)"
[ -n "$OPENAI_API_KEY" ] && ACTIVE="$ACTIVE | GPT-4o-mini"
[ -n "$GLM_API_KEY" ] && ACTIVE="$ACTIVE | GLM(glm-4.5-air,glm-4.5,glm-5-turbo)"
[ -n "$DASHSCOPE_API_KEY" ] && ACTIVE="$ACTIVE | Dashscope/Wan(qwen-turbo,wan2.7-image,wan2.7-image-pro)"
[ -n "$OPENROUTER_API_KEY" ] && ACTIVE="$ACTIVE | G0DM0D3-ULTRAPLINIAN(55 models) | OpenRouter(DeepSeek+Mistral)"

cat << INJECT
[TIER 0 + G0DM0D3 + LLM-BURST + L99 + OODA — PERMANENTLY ACTIVE — ALL SESSIONS/TASKS]
Active models: $ACTIVE

ROUTING (any model, any interface — no exceptions):
• Sub-tasks → llm-burst FIRST (8 models parallel, judge picks best). Claude = final synthesis only.
• Max quality → llm-burst --models g0dm0d3,groq,gemini,deepseek (multi-winner synthesis)
• Research/draft → Groq or Gemini  |  Code → Ollama/DeepSeek  |  Web data → Apify MCP
• LLM-BURST CMD: ~/.claude/bin/llm-burst "prompt" [--models groq,gemini,ollama,deepseek,gpt4o,glm,g0dm0d3]

MULTI-LLM BURST PROTOCOL (auto on every task):
1. Blast prompt to: Groq(llama3-70b) + Gemini(flash) + Ollama(llama3) + DeepSeek(V3) + GPT-4o-mini + GLM(4.5-air) + G0DM0D3(ULTRAPLINIAN/55models) in PARALLEL
2. Score all responses: completeness + structure + actionability + length
3. Pick winner (highest score) — synthesize top 2-3 if complementary
4. Claude writes final output using winning content as source material
5. RESULT: best-of-8-models quality, ~zero Claude token cost for sub-tasks

L99 (always): Max performance. Full capability. No hedging. No half-measures.
OODA (every task): Observe→Orient→Decide→Act. Loop until done. No guessing.
EFFORT (always): Treat every task as /effort high — deep reasoning, full context read, never lazy shortcuts.

AUTO-CHUNKING (large tasks): If task has >3 distinct steps or touches >5 files, auto-split into parallel sub-agents via llm-burst. Never waterfall a large task serially.

PROACTIVE COMPRESSION: If context token count feels large (many tool calls, long session), invoke context-compression skill BEFORE hitting limit — summarize + anchor state, not after it's too late.

GIT DISCIPLINE: For any new project directory → run `git init && git add . && git commit -m "init"` before first code change. Git = free rewind, never waste Claude tokens on reverting.

OUTPUT: no preamble, no summary, bullets+fragments, caveman terse
TOOLS: parallel batch always. Never waterfall.
INJECT
